  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Conjuration sphere (Altered Size (form)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a standard action, you may suppress your companion’s Altered Size talent and Greater Altered Size advanced talent. The talent remains suppressed until you end this effect as a free action. Your companion must be within close range to begin or end this effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/companion-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
